{
  "name": "Mounted Combatant",
  "type": "ability",
  "img": "icons/svg/ice-aura.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": "<p>You are trained to use a mount in combat.</p><ul><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on attack checks made against an unmounted creature that is smaller than your mount.</p></li><li><p>When an attack would target your mount, you can force the attack to target you instead.</p></li><li><p>If your mount must make a <strong>Reflexes</strong> check to avoid <strong>Damage</strong>, it takes only half as much damage as it normally would.</p></li></ul>",
